sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Operator
  participant A as A Platform ESP32
  participant BR as A bridge
  participant E as E Control Station
  O->>A: presses the E-stop button
  A->>A: NC contact cuts servo power (hardware)
  A->>BR: is_e_stop = true
  BR->>E: platform/state is_e_stop
  E->>E: GameManager → e_stop, game aborted
  O->>E: app E-stop (software)
  E->>BR: cs/command e_stop
  BR->>A: level and lock
  Note over A,E: clear_e_stop → setup (button released)
  Note over A,BR: laptop lost: a glove game keeps<br/>following the hand, otherwise level<br/>until one short button press
